# Buildroot makeusers table (BR2_ROOTFS_USERS_TABLES): users that services
# expect, created at image build time because the root filesystem is a
# read-only squashfs.
# Columns: username uid group gid password home shell groups comment.
#
# orion-node.service runs as orion (same entry as Orion's
# packaging/buildroot/orion-users.table).
orion -1 orion -1 * - /bin/false dialout Orion node
